# Workflow

Implement one assignment phase at a time. After each functionality:

1. Add or update tests for the behavior you just built (unit tests for domain/calculation/visibility; functional tests for admin, wizard, auth, PDF).
2. Run the relevant test suite and fix failures before moving on.
3. Stop so the user can review.

Do not implement later assignment phases unless asked.

Run the `review` subagent (`.cursor/agents/review.md`) when the user asks for review.

PHP 8.4, no `empty()`, Twig macros, thin controllers, no generic manager abstractions.
